<title>UK: Trafficmaster moves further into red in H1.</title>
<headline>Trafficmaster moves further into red in H1.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		6.2 loss	     vs 5.1 loss</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 nil		    vs nil</p>
<p> Pretax		     1.4 loss	     vs 1.1 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   1.3		    vs 1.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Trafficmaster Plc, maker of electronic traffic monitoring systems, said on Tuesday the increase in losses was due to disruption from a new frequency and anticipated higher network costs.</p>
</text>
